      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '(Press T to close and reopen this menu)

    (Also scroll and read this
    its like 1 sentence)*


    Hello! Mess with the settings as much as you want,
    send us a Google Form with a screenshot if you find settings you like more than
    the presets. Also just send us a Google Form with whatever initial feedback you
    have. I know there is not much to do except move but that is kind of the point.
    If you think there is some sort of movement missing also let us know with the
    Form. Press  ''Update'' after you move the sliders around, press one of the ''Preset''
    buttons for an instant update to that preset. Thank you!


    -Carson and Caden
    :)

















































































    *I
    lied


'
